Subject: [PATCH] msdaps: row and rowset proxies, ICommand::Execute parameters,
 Bind for other objects (3191)

row_server.c: the rowset proxy and server forward RestartPosition, Compare, GetRowsByBookmark and Hash
(the bookmark arrays travel as one buffer), GetReferencedRowset and GetSpecification, AddRefAccessor; IRow::
GetSourceRowset and Open for rows and for other objects; the server hands back rowsets wrapped so they marshal
as rowset servers; IMarshal::DisconnectObject. usrmarshal.c: ICommand::Execute marshals DBPARAMS (the rows
and the data behind their pointer slots, as an RMTPACK; output parameters come back), IBindResource::Bind
for objects other than rows and rowsets.

